# Optional: pre-fill the Telegram API credentials for this deployment.
#
# 1. Sign in at https://my.telegram.org
# 2. Open "API development tools" (https://my.telegram.org/apps)
# 3. Create an app and copy its api_id and api_hash below.
#
# These are application identifiers, not account secrets. They are embedded in
# the client bundle (and sent to Telegram in initConnection), so never commit
# your real .env file. Leave both values empty to let each visitor enter their
# own credentials on the login screen; those are saved only in their browser.
#
# Vite only exposes variables prefixed with VITE_ to client code.
VITE_TELEGRAM_API_ID=
VITE_TELEGRAM_API_HASH=
